  data: {
    LLM: 'Correlativa follows a train-style domino layout from a central opening double. Players extend legal train ends by matching pips. If a player cannot play, they draw one tile from the boneyard and continue drawing until they can play or the boneyard is exhausted. The deal ends when a player empties their hand or all players are blocked with no draw available.',
    Player: 'Correlativa follows a train-style domino layout from a central opening double. Players extend legal train ends by matching pips. If a player cannot play, they draw one tile from the boneyard and continue drawing until they can play or the boneyard is exhausted. The deal ends when a player empties their hand or all players are blocked with no draw available.',
    objective: 'Play all your tiles first, or in a blocked position finish with the lowest remaining pip total.',
    gameplay: 'Correlativa follows a train-style domino layout from a central opening double. Players extend legal train ends by matching pips. If a player cannot play, they draw one tile from the boneyard and continue drawing until they can play or the boneyard is exhausted. The deal ends when a player empties their hand or all players are blocked with no draw available.',
